WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:04.180
Come on, Hanadori. Get out of there already.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.400
It's time to go teach the little kids.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.180
Even you, a shy boy who's awkward around girls
and covered in dark god of destruction juice,

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.740
should be able to handle some kids.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.700
<b>Sigh</b>

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.080
Must be nice to be the guy
 who got on the student council!

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.680
Life is so easy for you!

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.950
<i>After all the chaos he caused,</i>

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:26.600
<i>Hanadori-kun lost the student 
council elections miserably.</i>

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.290
<b>S H O C K</b>

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.650
<i>The only new electee was Tsukimiya-kun, 
who became the council's auditor.</i>

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.210
<b>Tsukimiya Utsugi</b>

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.490
<b>The Truth of the Universe</b>

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:35.480
<i>Hanadori-kun's jealousy was a thing to behold.</i>

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.540
I can feel it. Miguel's coming.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.800
He's about to go out of control.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.910
You guys are lucky.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.480
You can be on the student council because 
you don't have the world to protect.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.000
Come on down here, Gestöber.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.700
Ditch that jerk of a wannabe genius
and we can make our own secret base.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:52.700
Hey.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.640
Come on out, Kabu-dono.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.780
You're causing problems for Koyukichi-dono.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:59.750
<i>Good grief... I'd love to 
just leave him in there,</i>

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:03.580
<i>but since we're in the same group,
I'll get in trouble if he doesn't do the work.</i>

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.420
It's Miguel-oniichan!

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:07.490
You're...

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.380
You came to see me at my preschool?

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.880
Oh, you're the girl from the restaurant.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.420
Have you been well?

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.220
Yup!

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:19.640
I was hoping I'd get to see you again!

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:21.640
Tell me all about hell, okay?

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.700
And let's eat lunch together!

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:28.400
Okay! Gather around, everyone!

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.040
Come play with Miguel-oniichan!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.570
<i>A complete 180!</i>

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.520
Come play with Miguel-oniichan!

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.530
<i>Now he's in a great mood.</i>

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.090
<i>Well, it's better than him pouting.</i>

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:58.340
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:14.160
<i>And so our day of helping out at the
 preschool got off to an... okay... start.</i>

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:14.040
<b><i>Delusion 9</i></b>

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.040
Let's play, Onii-chan!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.360
Let's play!

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.720
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.840
<i>I don't know how to talk to kids!</i>

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.050
Hello there.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.500
My name is Utsugi.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.760
I'm Masato!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.350
Masato-kun, huh?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.980
That's a cool name.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.700
Okay, let's go to the playroom.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.520
<i>I see!</i>

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:34.520
Follow me!

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:35.480
<i>First, you put yourself on their level...</i>

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.730
<i>I refuse to lose to Tsukimiya.</i>

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.020
<i>You're still mad about that?</i>

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.080
<i>Give it up and face facts.</i>

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:46.120
<i>You shouldn't act like that in front of kids.</i>

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.360
Oh, wow!

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.020
Easy, right?

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:50.860
Yup!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:53.760
Now you give it a try.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.830
<i>Even Mogami-kun the social 
reject is doing well...</i>

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.000
<i>I won't lose to Mogami, either!</i>

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.150
<i>Why, though?</i>

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.090
<i>He didn't get on the student council, either!</i>

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.160
Hello!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.420
Goodbye!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.420
That's so neat!

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:05.900
<i>Not Tanaka, either!</i>

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:06.840
<i>Who is Tanaka?!</i>

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.060
<i>Are you just mad at everyone?</i>

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.560
So Tsukimiya headed to the playroom?

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.920
Let's follow him.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.150
Heh heh heh!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.620
Heh heh heh...

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.010
<i>Is this okay?</i>

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:17.780
Oh, Koyuki-kun!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.680
Could you help me for a second?

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.700
<b>Home Ec Room</b>

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.910
So I'm making the cakes?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:29.620
We're having a surprise party for the 
kids with December birthdays at lunch.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:33.370
I was hoping you could do the decorating 
and write little messages for them.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.460
Th-That's a big job...

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.110
I've never done this before.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.140
Don't worry, don't worry!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.820
I'll help you.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.550
Sensei!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.870
What's wrong, Takkun?

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:46.700
I'm not playing with Yu-kun anymore!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.040
I hate him!

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.520
Goodness... What happened?

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.310
<i>It's hard being in preschool.</i>

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.140
<i>Was I like that?</i>

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.440
<i>Yeah, there's always fighting.</i>

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:02.150
I'm never talking to you again! I hate you!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.160
<i>I remember "I'll never talk to you again!"</i>

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.880
Listen to this, Gestöber!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:04.870
<i>It was you?!</i>

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.660
Tsukimiya's a meanie!

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:09.280
<i>Why are you so unstable?</i>

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.400
<i>What happened?</i>

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:14.580
Tsukimiya is stealing away 
all my hopes and dreams!

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:18.600
Look! I can walk on stilts now!

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.460
You're amazing, Utsugi-oniichan!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:24.300
I'm going to marry you!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.200
<i>Tsukimiya-kun, you didn't need to 
trample Hanadori-kun's pride like that...</i>

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.190
You're a very noisy man.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.080
How long have you even known Tsukimiya-dono?

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.390
If you can reject him so readily, Kabu-dono,

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.220
you'll never reach the heights that 
Koyukichi-dono and I have attained.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.690
<i>Sorry, I reject you, too.</i>

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.120
Now, now...

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:49.300
Takkun, Hanadori-kun,

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.070
we all have things we don't
like about each other.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:57.750
But you know what makes your friends special 
better than anyone else, don't you?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:03.100
Remember how excited you were to make 
Yu-kun a surprise present for his birthday?

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.960
I don't wanna anymore.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:08.120
Do you remember the day you became friends?

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.260
The first time he talked to you.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.980
The first time you went 
on adventures together.

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:17.940
The first time you told someone, 
"He's my friend."

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.480
Didn't that make you happy?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.520
Didn't everything seem bright and shiny?

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:29.950
I've known Tsukimiya since preschool.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.960
The day I first met him...

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.380
<i>You don't remember?!</i>

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:42.060
I don't know why you were fighting,

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:45.470
but if you want to talk to him again,

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.930
you just need a little bit of courage.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.430
<b>Hijiri Preschool</b>

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.430
<b>Hijiri
 Preschool</b>

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:52.430
Hey.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:56.630
Are you just going to stand there 
until someone talks to you?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:01.280
If you want to be friends with someone, 
say the words of courage.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.940
"The words of courage!"

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.550
No, I mean...

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.060
My head...

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:12.760
Tsukimiya always understood me.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:18.840
He was always there for young 
Sturmhut before he met Gestöber.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.980
Are you okay, Hanadori?

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:26.110
<b>Shake</b>

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.540
Tsukimiya!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.160
Are you okay, Hanadori?

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:28.050
<b>Shake</b>

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.330
Listen. You have a special power.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:30.820
Special power... awaken...

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.410
I'll do whatever Tsukimiya-kun tells me to!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.440
<i>You were brainwashed?</i>

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.260
Then, in high school...

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:42.760
That guy, Koyuki Seri-kun, 
was your partner in a previous life.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.060
<i>The cause of it all!</i>

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.580
If it weren't for Tsukimiya, I'd...

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.030
<i>If it weren't for Tsukimiya-kun, I'd...</i>

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.240
I need your help, Gestöber.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.850
Thank you for the meal!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:59.290
Everyone, we have a surprise cake today!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.270
Cake?!

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.500
What for?!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:05.590
H-Happy birthday to everyone born in December!

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:07.300
Yay!

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.670
And... And this is for Tsukimiya!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:19.770
<b>Ta-</b>

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:19.770
<b>da!</b>

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:15.190
I asked Gestöber to make it for me.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.200
It's spelled wrong, though...

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.770
<b>Tsukimiya Utsugi</b>

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.770
Your birthday is December 12th, right?

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.420
Happy birthday, Tsukimiya.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:23.840
And...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.570
Congratulations on getting 
onto the student council.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:29.860
I can't do anything to help you,

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.280
but I'm sure you're better 
suited for it than me.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:36.490
<b>Tsukimiya Utsugi</b>

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.780
Do your best.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.500
You're not mad anymore, Hanadori?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.100
O-Of course not.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.450
I hope we can still be friends.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.420
Sure. Thanks, Hanadori!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:52.240
It... It actually really hurt 
to be in a fight with you!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:54.300
You never change, Hanadori.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.240
<i>I bet he's manipulated you your whole life.</i>

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.180
<b>Hijiri Preschool</b>

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.180
<b>Hijiri
Preschool</b>

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.740
Um, Tsukimiya-kun...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.440
Be my friend.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:12.940
I couldn't help recalling it.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.150
Hanadori was so cute when he was little.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.700
D-Dummyhead! You're making me blush!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.800
<i>Dum... Oh, forget it.</i>

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.630
<i>What was that all about?</i>

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:30.450
<i>Will the day ever come when I look back 
on meeting these guys with nostalgia?</i>

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:35.170
<i>It's not exactly something 
I want to remember...</i>

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.250
Oh, by the way, Seri-kun...

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.720
We were reviewing the work 
the student council does,

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:44.980
and we all decided we should 
let the runner-up join, too.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:48.470
I could use the help...

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.080
<i>What? No!</i>

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.740
<i>If I do that, it'll happen again...</i>

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.110
Gestöber, you traitor!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.170
<i>Hanadori-kun will throw another fit.</i>

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:57.040
N-No, I can't...

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:59.340
So since you were the runner-up, 
Hanadori, why not join?

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.690
Me? Really?

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.080
What should I do?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.140
I came in second?

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.480
I got more votes than Gestöber?

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.060
I feel kind of bad...

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.490
Will he be jealous?

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:18.780
If everyone finds out that he 
got fewer votes than I did...

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:22.820
Still, only the chosen can participate.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.110
I hate to say it,

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.920
but I did get more votes...

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:30.900
But, you know, I'm glad 
I worked up the courage to run.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.100
Effort doesn't always pay off, tho—

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.580
You bastards!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:41.990
<b>Hahahaha</b>

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.310
Why are you so damn cocky?!
You act like you just slew an ogre!

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:42.000
Tsukimiya! Why'd you look 
at me when you said that?!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.440
Please slay this ogre too, Koyukichi-dono!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.700
You jerk! Moron! Asshole! Screw you!

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:46.700
Take off this worthless ogre's head!

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:49.170
Gestöber!

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:51.380
Please, hear me out!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:53.390
I'm sorry!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:59.680
I'm so sorry I hurt you! I didn't realize you 
wanted to be on the student council so badly!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:03.240
Don't worry, Gestöber! You have value!

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:07.480
Even if nobody else votes for you, I will!

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:10.450
So please, Gestöber!

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:12.670
Tsukimiya...

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:16.330
Sometimes words of courage 
don't get across, huh?

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.780
That's right, Hanadori.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:23.950
RIP
Koyuki

