00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:23.950
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:23.950
RIP
Koyuki

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:23.040
<i>Now I have something else I want to forget...</i>

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:30.500
<b>Christmas Party

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.960
Pathetic.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:30.510
Becoming mere cattle, 
brainwashed and manipulated...

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:32.300
Nothing more than sheeple.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:36.220
If you want to celebrate the birth 
of a god, celebrate mine instead.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:38.540
What? You're not going, Hanadori?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.260
Seri-kun's looking forward to it.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:45.830
Um, are you going to the 
Christmas party too, Koyuki-kun?

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:47.680
Y-Yeah.

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.540
Are you, Sumiso-san?

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:50.520
Yup!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.570
<i>I already bought something 
for the gift exchange, but...</i>

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.640
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:02.280
<i>Would this look good on Sumiso-san?</i>

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:07.030
<i>Since I didn't get to give her a 
birthday present thanks to them...</i>

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.960
<i>No, maybe it's better if I don't.</i>

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:14.880
<i>Maybe getting something 
specially for her would be creepy.</i>

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.120
<i>And, actually...</i>

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:20.180
<i>Is she even coming today?</i>

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:24.910
<i>It's Christmas Eve, and snow storms 
are blowing all across Japan...</i>

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.720
<i>Today's the Christmas party 
that Tsukimiya-kun suggested...</i>

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:32.400
<i>or probably just forced through
 the student council.</i>

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:33.770
<i>Oh, jeez...</i>

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.100
<i>I'm still early. I should 
find somewhere to chill...</i>

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:39.000
I'm begging you!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:43.070
<b>Yakiniku・Horumon</b>

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:43.080
Please, sell me a Black Santa outfit!

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:47.550
I need Koyukichi-dono to wear it!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.520
<i>Mogami-kun, what are you doing?</i>

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:51.870
Sir, this is a yakiniku shop!
We don't have those!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.170
What?!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.460
You don't know the legend of Black Santa?

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.900
Black Santa Claus visits 
bad little girls and boys

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:03.900
and gives them awful things 
like rocks or bloody intestines...

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.140
or even beats them with his sack!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:11.980
I'm a bad boy! So I need a Black Santa 
outfit for Koyukichi-dono!

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.320
<i>Hey, stop that!</i>

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:16.700
<i>Do you always shout my 
name in public like that?</i>

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.700
Please! For Koyukichi-dono!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:21.080
<i>Also, why would a yakiniku 
place sell Santa outfits?</i>

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.610
Please!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.700
I smell Koyukichi-dono!

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:24.660
He's close!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.500
<i>How can you tell at this distance?!</i>

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.480
<i>You're scary!</i>

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.270
<i>Starting over!</i>

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.860
<i>Today's the Christmas party.</i>

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:37.760
<i>I was just hoping to see Sumiso-san...</i>

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.840
<i>But I can't drag my feet like this!</i>

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:44.490
<i>Sumiso-san is popular with regular 
guys who are constantly looking</i>

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:47.520
<i>for a way to get closer to her, 
but don't have the guts to do it.</i>

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:49.760
<i>I can tell!</i>

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.820
<i>I have to tell her how I feel...</i>

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:56.880
This is for me?

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.460
A Christmas present! How wonderful!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:05.110
Do you... like me, Koyuki-kun?

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:11.210
Koyuki-kun...

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:14.430
<i>...and get her to realize it!</i>

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.480
Hibiki-kun?!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.170
<b>Careful

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.020
I got snowblown by a snowblower!

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:26.500
<i>How does that even happen?</i>

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.020
I knew nobody liked me!

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.920
I got Helius-blown!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:33.400
My present for the gift exchange is ruined!

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:36.780
I was looking forward to 
my first Christmas party!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:40.460
I don't have the right to participate...

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.470
I'm a grim reaper, after all.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:46.330
If I go, the cake will spoil, 
and everyone will be cursed.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.660
I'm a grim reaper, after all.

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:50.400
<i>You don't have to get all poetic...</i>

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:54.200
My mommy told me Santa doesn't 
come to our house, either.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:58.060
Here, Hibiki-kun. Take it.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:00.560
For the gift exchange.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.960
But Senpai, this is...

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.970
I bought extra.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.660
Are you sure?

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.460
Go have fun.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.290
See you later!

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:15.700
<i>I know that's what I said...</i>

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:18.140
<i>But what will I do for the gift exchange now?</i>

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.320
<i>Well, I've still got Sumiso-san's gift...</i>

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.900
<i>Anyway, I need to get going 
before I run into any more trouble.</i>

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.820
Hey, wake up!

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:27.820
Are you okay?

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.400
Where is Utsugi-sama?

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.150
Mogami-san?

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:33.210
What are you doing? Where is your coat?

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:34.560
You know her?

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.060
Good, good.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.770
I saw Utsugi-sama walking 
with a middle-aged woman

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:40.200
and ran out of the house.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:43.210
You'd better hurry home and 
warm up before you get sick!

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:45.880
I have to go.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.040
You can't!

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:49.000
You understand, don't you, Koyuki Seri?

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:51.570
I have to see him today.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:54.720
Even if he's seeing someone else.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.810
Then at least wear this.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:02.810
I'm in a hurry!

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:05.430
Bye! Go home soon!

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:08.850
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:11.150
<i>I don't have time to go buy anything else.</i>

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.010
<i>I need to at least get to the party...</i>

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.000
<i>I want to see Sumiso-san!</i>

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:17.990
<i>I fell into a hole!</i>

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.490
<i>What is this? Someone help!</i>

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:20.240
<i>I can't get out!</i>

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:25.870
<i>Why does this always happen to me?</i>

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.460
<i>I guess it's fine.</i>

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.860
<i>I wouldn't have had the courage 
to give it to her, anyway.</i>

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.150
Don't give up, little boy.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.750
Santa-san?

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:38.200
I've been watching you.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:41.800
There's someone you want to see, isn't there?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.540
It's Christmas Eve.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:47.310
God wouldn't let a good boy suffer.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.060
Thank you,

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:51.780
but it's okay.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:55.750
My clothes are all dirty now,
and I don't have a present for her.

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:01.600
Then give her this.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:05.540
It's a silver accessory. 
I'm sure she'll love it.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:08.400
Merry Christmas, little boy!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.900
I can't believe it!

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.620
Koyukichi-dono got my present!

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.470
I'm so glad I spent all 
that time looking for it!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.680
You're sure getting into the spirit, Koyuki.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.400
It's so cute, Gestöber-senpai!

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.160
<i>My clothes got all dirty, 
so I didn't have a choice...</i>

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.650
Number 8!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:29.940
Whoever's got number 8, come on up!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:35.480
<i>Anyway, I took this, but I can't 
really give it to anyone, can I?</i>

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:38.160
<i>I should give it back to that Santa.</i>

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.660
What? You haven't turned in your present yet?

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.370
I'll take it up for you, so go eat.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.610
Number 7!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:48.790
Bingo!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.300
I got this one!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.390
S-Sumiso-san, that's...

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:56.960
What? Was this yours, Koyuki-kun?

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:58.080
What a coincidence.

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.600
Can I open it?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.920
<i>Is this okay?</i>

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:02.550
Huh? Oh, uh... Sure.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.240
What a beautiful necklace!

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:06.670
Is it handmade?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:07.760
<i>That's...</i>

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:10.620
Are you sure about this, Miguel?

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:12.920
You were so excited

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:18.010
about dressing up as Santa and giving 
Gestöber a matching accessory.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.520
It's fine.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:21.860
Gestöber worked hard today.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:25.940
Though it was an awful thing 
to do to you, Schlecht.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:28.620
After you spent all that time teaching 
me how to make accessories...

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:29.970
It's fine.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.080
It's been a while since we've 
gotten to spend time together.

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:40.880
Honestly... That Gestöber is 
lucky you care for him so much.

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:44.010
I'm sorry, Sumiso-san.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.730
I think that present was...

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.190
I just love it!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:49.680
Thank you, Koyuki-kun!

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:56.650
<i>Sumiso-san's happy, and I got to 
do what I came here for, but...</i>

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.760
<i>Don't give up, little boy.</i>

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.580
I'm sorry.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:06.160
Sumiso-san, I'm pretty sure
that was meant for me.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:10.460
I know I'm probably not 
making any sense, but...

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:14.660
I'm glad.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.520
It was important to you, wasn't it?

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.090
Th-Thank you.

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:22.390
I'm sorry. I...

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.910
I really wanted you to...

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:30.230
RIP 
Koyuki

