00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:30.230
RIP 
Koyuki

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:36.940
Gestöber! What are you doing here?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:41.400
You made this for me, didn't you?

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:43.900
Y-You could tell?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.160
<i>Well, obviously.</i>

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:49.700
So, anyway, since you gave it to me...

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.670
Thanks.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.360
Sure thing.

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.860
<i>What a mess of a Christmas this has been.</i>

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:05.000
<i>I can't believe I'm spending 
it with Hanadori-kun.</i>

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.420
Koyuki-kun!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.340
S-Sumiso-san! How—

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:13.820
Does it look good on me?

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.740
Wait, what? How...

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:19.530
I thought the pale pink would look good 
draped on Sumiso Kotoko's shoulders.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:24.240
I told her what happened and
 delivered the gift to its rightful owner.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:28.610
I asked why she'd want something that had
 already been given to another girl, but...

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:34.070
Can I really have it?

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:36.220
O-Of cour—

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:38.180
Hey, Gestöber-senpai!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:42.380
I was gifted dinner for two at a restaurant.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.840
<b>Gift Certificate</b>

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.960
Since you gave me your present,

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.730
I want you to have this.

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:48.550
<b>Gift Certificate</b>

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.560
Huh? Is this restaurant...

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.980
Congratulations!

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:55.690
You're our hundredth couple today!

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.900
<i>Wh-What is with today?!</i>

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.230
Why not go and enjoy yourselves, Koyuki Seri?

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:06.780
Th-Then, um...

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.860
Let's go.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.650
Merry Christmas!

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:11.870
Not you!

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:18.290
Two Santas eating dinner together!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:22.320
Kotoko, just forgot those losers.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.680
What's so great about them?

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.360
They're such good friends!

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:30.350
Kotoko, is that really enough for you?

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.300
Wasn't that tasty, Gestöber?

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.110
Are you sure this was all right, Shi-chan?

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.110
Are you sure you don't want more?

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:36.360
I lied to them about being
 the hundredth couple.

00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:37.100
Oh, you're full? Okay.

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.140
The manager's gonna get mad at me!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:40.700
Then let's spend next Christmas here, too!

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:42.800
Even an angel like Miguel needs a gift.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.800
It's a promise, Gestöber!

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:46.080
I'll let him have his fun tonight.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.220
Okay, I'm taking the picture, guys!

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:49.900
Ready?

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:52.720
Friends forever!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:54.480
<i>Don't make that our thing!</i>

00:23:25.490 --> 00:23:26.750
It's no use.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.630
Our animators are gone,
and I can't get this colored.

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:31.260
It's the Lunar New Year, 
and I can't get anyone to work!

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.050
We really are out of options this time!

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:37.000
We'll just have to offer 
five times the pay per cut!

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:39.540
Don't! We'll run out of budget!
